        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlarge your Eggplant is a game that holds its title well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to grow your eggplant, make it bigger than anyone else, and be proud of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/2061952b2fa027ecda166c1c6a1eb47d.avif?t=1773940190\" width=480 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jean-Michel, your neighbor, has the biggest eggplant around, and you're very jealous of him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you find a way to solve all your problems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/bc01be4b667e24e94661b5277b33773e.avif?t=1773940190\" width=480 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clicker game with a deep and moving story, plot-twists, sports, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.poster.avif?t=1773940190\" width=814 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.webm?t=1773940190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.mp4?t=1773940190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlarge your Eggplant is a game that holds its title well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to grow your eggplant, make it bigger than anyone else, and be proud of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/2061952b2fa027ecda166c1c6a1eb47d.avif?t=1773940190\" width=480 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jean-Michel, your neighbor, has the biggest eggplant around, and you're very jealous of him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you find a way to solve all your problems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/bc01be4b667e24e94661b5277b33773e.avif?t=1773940190\" width=480 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clicker game with a deep and moving story, plot-twists, sports, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.poster.avif?t=1773940190\" width=814 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.webm?t=1773940190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896470/extras/9233c6c0acd82f590f59ea7352ab421b.mp4?t=1773940190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
